## Ghost role
symbiote-ghostrole-name = Symbiote
symbiote-ghostrole-desc = A creature of living biomass that bonds with a host, granting them a second brain and an arsenal of biomass weaponry.
symbiote-ghostrole-rules = You are a [color=#9999ff][bold]Symbiote[/bold][/color]. [color=#e00d26][bold]NEVER[/bold][/color] intentionally harm or grief your host, or expect punishment from above. Briefly taking over their speech or movement is fine.
    Your host's allegiances and grudges are yours. If they're killed, you may kill their killer, even after their death.
    You're not obligated to find a new host. Without one, you're unaffiliated, and follow standard engagement rules.

## Alerts
alerts-symbiote-chemicals-name = Chemicals
alerts-symbiote-chemicals-desc = Corrosive cyan stuff that lets you do other stuff.

